spans.s:
(II)--a शक्ति;
1: Br. IV. ४४. ७५;
a mind-born mother.
2: M. १७९. १४.

(I)--a daughter of Vasudeva and देवकी: queen of Arjuna, mother of अभिमण्यु, and grandmother of परीक्षित्, younger sister of कृष्ण of dark complexion;
1: भा. IX. २४. ५५; २२. ३३; M. ४६. १५; ५०. ५६; वा. ९६. १७५-6; Vi. IV. २०. ५१. ९९. २४९.
taken by कृष्ण to द्वारका;
2: भा. X. ६४ [११];
heard from the wives of कृष्ण of their marriage and was in wonder;
3: Ib. X. ८४. 1.
grieved at कृष्ण's departure from हस्तिनापुर: welcomed Vidura;
4: Ib. I. १०. 9; १३. 3.
the pride of the वृष्णिस्.
5: Br. III. ७१. १७७-8.
